{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2022-06-13 09:00:00', 'title': "HONEYWELL'S LEGENDARY BOEING 757 TEST AIRCRAFT TURNS 40 YEARS OLD", 'text': "THE ONE-OF-A-KIND TEST AIRCRAFT HAS BEEN AT THE FOREFRONT OF DRIVING TECHNOLOGICAL ADVANCES IN THE AVIATION INDUSTRY AND IS NOT RETIRING ANY TIME SOON PHOENIX , JUNE 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TURNING 40 YEARS OLD SIGNALS THE BEGINNING OF MIDDLE AGE FOR MOST PEOPLE, BUT WHEN AN AIRCRAFT TURNS 40 YEARS OLD, THAT IS A BIGGER MILESTONE ALTOGETHER. MOST PASSENGER AIRCRAFT ARE RETIRED AND SCRAPPED BY AGE 40, BUT FOR HONEYWELL'S (NASDAQ: HON) ICONIC BOEING 757 TEST AIRCRAFT, TURNING 40 SIMPLY MEANS THERE IS MUCH MORE HIGH-FLYING ADVENTURE TO COME."}